# What the runtime image (Dockerfile) is built from, and nothing else: the build context is what deploy/deploy.sh
# ships (site/, app/ and the public docs) plus the server and package.json ("type": "module"). The agent image
# (.maul/Dockerfile) copies nothing from the context, so this list is the runtime image's alone.
*
!package.json
!server/serve.js
!site
!app
!docs/AGENTS.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/DEVICES.md
!docs/UX-RESEARCH.md
!docs/VISION.md
!docs/BRAND.md
!docs/REMOTE-MCP.md
!docs/GUIDE.md
!docs/BENCH.md
# Never committed (.gitignore), so never in CI's build; kept out of a local one too, which would otherwise differ.
app/kits
app/community
app/site-config.json
app/vendor/ort
app/vendor/models
**/.DS_Store
